    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-800 text-white">Money-Back Promise</h2>
      <p class="text-ink-200 mt-4 leading-relaxed">We are proud of our products. Our Money-Back Promise symbolizes our confidence in our education solutions and our belief in their quality and effectiveness. Every classroom is unique, so we encourage students to reach out to us for personalized support.</p>
